free proposal in your inbox within 24 hours.</p></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-24 lg:py-32 bg-gray-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-blue-100 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100\">🕐</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-blue-600 mb-0.5\">24/7 Real Support</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">We never close. Real humans answer every message, any time. No bots, ever.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-indigo-100 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-100\">📧</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-indigo-600 mb-0.5\">Email Us</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">info@mylobstr.com — for project inquiries and detailed questions.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border-2 border-emerald-100 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl shrink-0 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100\">📍</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-sm text-emerald-600 mb-0.5\">Albany Based</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">We&#x27;re local. We can meet for coffee — seriously, we love that.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 p-5 text-white\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed\">💙 <strong>No pressure, no sales pitch.</strong> If your project isn&#x27;t a good fit, we&#x27;ll tell you honestly and even point you in the right direction. Albany businesses deserve straight talk.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-100 shadow-xl overflow-hidden\"><form class=\"p-8 space-y-5\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">Your Name *</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Maria Johnson\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none transition-colors text-sm bg-gray-50\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">Email Address *</label><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@yourbusiness.com\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none transition-colors text-sm bg-gray-50\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">Business Name *</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Capital Cuts Barbershop\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none transition-colors text-sm bg-gray-50\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">Type of Business *</label><select required=\"\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none transition-colors text-sm bg-gray-50\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Select your business type...</option><option value=\"restaurant\">🍽️ Restaurant / Café / Food</option><option value=\"salon\">✂️ Salon / Barbershop / Spa</option><option value=\"contractor\">🔧 Contractor / Home Services</option><option value=\"pet\">🐾 Pet Care / Vet</option><option value=\"fitness\">💪 Gym / Fitness / Wellness</option><option value=\"education\">🎓 Tutor / School / Education</option><option value=\"retail\">🛍️ Retail / Shop</option><option value=\"other\">🏪 Other Local Business</option></select></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700\">Tell Us About Your Business</label><textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"What does your business do? Do you have an existing website? What&#x27;s your biggest challenge getting clients online? No wrong answers — we love details.\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-gray-100 focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none transition-colors text-sm bg-gray-50 resize-none\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-700 text-white font-bold rounded-2xl py-4 text-sm shadow-lg hover:scale-[1.01] transition-all disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:scale-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg>Get My Free Proposal — No Obligation</button><p class=\"text-center text-xs text-gray-400\">📍 Albany-based team · 🔒 We never spam · ⚡ Reply within 24 hours</p></form></div></div></div></div></section><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 text-white\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10\"><div class=\"f